      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.66 (up from ₹1.11 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹3.73b (up 180% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹566.5m (up 420% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (up from 8.2% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 22% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 31% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
